Z||000006||1FST2M6||03-01-2001||10:40 AM||||i miss stompin nuts with the SE.. the GT is Shiney but it's not an instant killer. I'm glad Jeff and i were able to do the swap! i can deal with slow. Now just need to ditch my wheels and get bigger ones and i'll be even happier!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  and one is PLENTY for me... i'd NEVER have any $ if i had 2! <P>||||reg||1
